WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
- When did style first become
a big deal in your life?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.163
'Cause I know you love style.
(dog barking)

00:00:04.163 --> 00:00:06.465
And you look stylish right now.

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:07.593
- Thank you,

00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:10.668
you know I grew up in New York.

00:00:10.668 --> 00:00:13.618
And I think that New York has that kind

00:00:13.618 --> 00:00:15.410
of influence on you.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.920
You know you walk down the street

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.350
and when I was a kid
growing up it was really,

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.460
I would see Andy Warhol.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.293
- Yeah.

00:00:23.293 --> 00:00:24.190
- You know walking down the street.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.573
You know and I,

00:00:25.573 --> 00:00:28.070
and I always appreciated style.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.840
I would look at like "GQ Magazine"

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.900
and dream about being
on the cover one day.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.690
And I was with Tom Hanks
and Will Smith years later.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:37.560
But when I was a kid,

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:41.560
kid I would sell stolen
polo shirts on 14th street

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.405
out of a box.

00:00:42.405 --> 00:00:44.969
(group laughing)

00:00:44.969 --> 00:00:47.790
- I love it this is like confessions.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.160
- Yes and I would carry the box around

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.940
on 14th street and I'm dreaming about,

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.220
you know one day I'm gonna
be on the cover of the GQ.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.810
And one day I can afford to
actually wear these clothes.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.650
And I don't know how it's all gonna work

00:00:58.650 --> 00:00:59.670
but I know I can do it.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.570
But in the meantime I'm
selling used stolen shirts.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:03.771
- I love it,

00:01:03.771 --> 00:01:04.920
I love it.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.330
We all had our weird things we did before.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.553
- Yes, yes, absolutely.

